Package: WimpTools
Type: Package
Title: Analysis of Weighted Implication Grid
Version: 1.1.0
Authors@R: person(given = "Alejandro",
                      family = "Sanfeliciano",
                      role = c("aut", "cre"),
                      email = "sanfeliciano.alejandro@gmail.com")
Maintainer: Alejandro Sanfeliciano <sanfeliciano.alejandro@gmail.com>
Description: Implements the Weighted Implication Grid (WimpGrid) framework based
             on Personal Construct Theory. The package analyzes the grid as a 
             weighted directed graph to compute structural measures of the 
             cognitive system, including hierarchy, centrality, and internal 
             conflict. Methodological details and theoretical foundations are 
             described in Sanfeliciano et al. (2025) 
             doi:10.3389/fpsyg.2025.1630920.
